&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h1 class=&quot;MuiGrid-root css-1j4zddb&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(37, 71, 123);&quot;&gt;Who we are:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;MuiGrid-root css-17v2lcf&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;Geotab ® is a global leader in IoT and connected transportation and certified “Great Place to Work™.” We are a company of diverse and talented individuals who work together to help businesses grow and succeed, and increase the safety and sustainability of our communities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;MuiGrid-root css-17v2lcf&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;MuiGrid-root css-17v2lcf&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;Geotab is advancing security, connecting commercial vehicles to the internet and providing web-based analytics to help customers better manage their fleets. Geotab’s open platform and Geotab Marketplace ®, offering hundreds of third-party solution options, allows both small and large businesses to automate operations by integrating vehicle data with their other data assets. Processing billions of data points a day, Geotab leverages data analytics and machine learning to improve productivity, optimize fleets through the reduction of fuel consumption, enhance driver safety and achieve strong compliance to regulatory changes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;MuiGrid-root css-17v2lcf&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;MuiGrid-root css-17v2lcf&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;Our team is growing and we’re looking for people who follow their passion, think differently and want to make an impact. Ours is a fast paced, ever changing environment. Geotabbers accept that challenge and are willing to take on new tasks and activities - ones that may not always be described in the initial job description. Join us for a fulfilling career with opportunities to innovate, great benefits, and our fun and inclusive work culture. Reach your full potential with Geotab. To see what it’s like to be a Geotabber, check out our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-inherit MuiLink-root MuiLink-underlineHover css-sbvzk&quot; style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot; href=&quot;https://careers.geotab.com/blog/&quot;&gt;blog&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;and follow us @InsideGeotab on&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-inherit MuiLink-root MuiLink-underlineHover css-sbvzk&quot; style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot; href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/insidegeotab/&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(37, 71, 123);&quot;&gt;Who you are:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;1,0&quot;&gt;We are always looking for amazing talent who can contribute to our growth and deliver results!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;1,1&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;1,2&quot;&gt; Geotab is seeking a Market Development and Partnerships Intern who will support market expansion across Southeast Asia&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;1,3&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;1,4&quot;&gt;. If you love technology, and are keen to join an industry leader — we would love to hear from you!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;1,5&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(37, 71, 123);&quot;&gt;What you&#39;ll do:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;3,0&quot;&gt;As a Market Development and Partnerships Intern your key area of responsibility will be building market intelligence, identifying partnership opportunities, developing an early-stage sales pipeline, and coordinating sales and partner activities across Southeast Asia&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;3,1&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;3,2&quot;&gt;. You will need to work closely with Business Development Managers, Channel teams, Marketing, and other cross-functional teams, as well as communicate with external partners and prospective customers&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;3,3&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;3,4&quot;&gt;. To be successful in this role you will be a proactive, organized, and customer-focused self-starter with strong written and verbal communication skills, listening skills, and the confidence to support conversations with external partners and internal stakeholders&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;3,5&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;3,6&quot;&gt;. In addition, the successful candidate will have strong research, analytical, and project management skills with an ability to manage multiple priorities and deadlines in a fast-paced, collaborative environment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;3,7&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;3,8&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(37, 71, 123);&quot;&gt;The opportunity:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;6 month work-term.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Full-time, paid internship: Monday - Friday.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Your first week at Geotab begins with &#39;GEO Launch&#39; - a one-week Employee Orientation. Click&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;postings-link&quot; style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot; href=&quot;https://www.geotab.com/blog/first-week/&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;here&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;to learn more!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Learn more about the Geotab Campus Program&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;postings-link&quot; style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot; href=&quot;https://www.geotab.com/blog/geotab-campus-program/&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;here&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;This posting is for an existing vacancy.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(37, 71, 123);&quot;&gt;How you&#39;ll make an impact:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_135504a6f39f4805-67&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;5,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;5,0,0,0&quot;&gt;Identify and document prospective customers, external partners, relevant industry events, and market opportunities for Geotab.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;5,0,0,1&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_135504a6f39f4805-68&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;5,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;5,1,0,0&quot;&gt;Support outbound prospecting through email, phone, LinkedIn, events, and other appropriate channels.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;5,1,0,1&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_135504a6f39f4805-69&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;5,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;5,2,0,0&quot;&gt;Qualify leads by gathering information about business needs, fleet requirements, decision-makers, timing, and potential fit.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;5,2,0,1&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_135504a6f39f4805-70&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;5,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;5,3,0,0&quot;&gt;Support the development of relevant messaging and follow-up plans for prospects and potential partners.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;5,3,0,1&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_135504a6f39f4805-71&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;5,4,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;5,4,0,0&quot;&gt;Nurture early-stage leads through timely follow-up and coordinate qualified meetings or introductions with Business Development Managers and Channel team members.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;5,4,0,1&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_135504a6f39f4805-72&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;5,5,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;5,5,0,0&quot;&gt;Support partner outreach, relationship mapping, meeting preparation, follow-up, and action tracking.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;5,5,0,1&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_135504a6f39f4805-73&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;5,6,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;5,6,0,0&quot;&gt;Communicate professionally with external partners, event organizers, prospective customers, and other market contacts.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;5,6,0,1&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_135504a6f39f4805-74&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;5,7,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;5,7,0,0&quot;&gt;Assist with sales presentations, partner briefings, demonstrations, events, and customer or partner calls as required.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;5,7,0,1&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_135504a6f39f4805-75&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;5,8,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;5,8,0,0&quot;&gt;Maintain accurate prospect, partner, activity, and pipeline information in Salesforce or other approved systems.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;5,8,0,1&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_135504a6f39f4805-76&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;5,9,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;5,9,0,0&quot;&gt;Prepare research summaries, market updates, pipeline reports, event recommendations, and other materials to support regional sales planning.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;5,9,0,1&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_135504a6f39f4805-77&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;5,10,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;5,10,0,0&quot;&gt;Coordinate projects and timelines across internal teams, ensuring actions, owners, and deadlines are clearly documented and followed up.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;5,10,0,1&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_135504a6f39f4805-78&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;5,11,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;5,11,0,0&quot;&gt;Provide feedback on market trends, customer needs, partner priorities, and campaign performance to support continuous improvement.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;5,11,0,1&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_135504a6f39f4805-79&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;5,12,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;5,12,0,0&quot;&gt;Collaborate with Marketing, Business Development, Channel, and other cross-functional teams to support lead-generation and partner-growth initiatives.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;5,12,0,1&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_135504a6f39f4805-80&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;5,13,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;5,13,0,0&quot;&gt;Develop a working knowledge of Geotab&#39;s products, Geotab Marketplace, target fleet applications, and the business objectives of customers and partners.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;5,13,0,1&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(37, 71, 123);&quot;&gt;What you&#39;ll bring to the role:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;MuiGrid-root css-17v2lcf&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_135504a6f39f4805-81&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;7,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;7,0,0,0&quot;&gt;Currently enrolled in, or recently graduated from, a Bachelors degree or post-secondary program in Business, Commerce, Marketing, Communications, International Business, or a related field (or equivalent combination of education/experience).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;7,0,0,1&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_135504a6f39f4805-82&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;7,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;7,1,0,0&quot;&gt;0 - 1 years of experience in related areas with an interest in sales development, partnerships, channel sales, technology, or business growth.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;7,1,0,1&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_135504a6f39f4805-83&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;7,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;7,2,0,0&quot;&gt;Strong research, analytical, organizational, and project management skills to handle multiple tasks, projects, and deadlines.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;7,2,0,1&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_135504a6f39f4805-84&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;7,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;7,3,0,0&quot;&gt;Excellent verbal and written communication skills in English, with the confidence to communicate professionally with external partners and internal stakeholders; additional Southeast Asian languages are an asset.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;7,3,0,1&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_135504a6f39f4805-85&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;7,4,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;7,4,0,0&quot;&gt;Customer-focused approach with strong listening skills, the ability to build rapport, and comfort explaining technical/business concepts to different audiences.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;7,4,0,1&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_135504a6f39f4805-86&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;7,5,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;7,5,0,0&quot;&gt;Technical competence using Google Workspace (Sheets, Docs, Slides); experience with Salesforce or another CRM is an asset.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;7,5,0,1&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_135504a6f39f4805-87&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;7,6,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140); font-size: 12pt;&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;7,6,0,0&quot;&gt;Proactive, dependable, and willing to take initiative while seeking guidance when needed.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;7,6,0,1&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;MuiGrid-root css-17v2lcf&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;If you got this far, we hope you&#39;re feeling excited about this role! Even if you don&#39;t feel you meet every single requirement, we still encourage you to apply.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;MuiGrid-root css-17v2lcf&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;MuiGrid-root css-1spul5l&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please note: Geotab does not accept agency resumes and is not responsible for any fees related to unsolicited resumes. Please do not forward resumes to Geotab employees.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;MuiGrid-root css-1spul5l&quot;&gt;
